{"bvid": "BV1M5m5Y2EP7", "title": "学英语要享受极致的重复，才能呆在牌桌上 | 话虽然糙了点，但学英语真的就是这个道理，享受极致的重复", "duration": 107, "subs": [{"cid": 26286885367, "lan": "ai-zh", "n": 48, "body": [{"from": 0.04, "to": 2.1, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "学英语呢它不是一锤子买卖", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 2.1, "to": 5.38, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "甚至在前期你做的总是亏本的生意", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 5.38, "to": 7.4, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "就你投入了时间和注意力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 7.4, "to": 9.76, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "但是这个语言学习的效果", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 9.76, "to": 12.2, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "它是需要很长很长的时间沉淀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 12.2, "to": 13.6, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "你才能感受到的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 13.6, "to": 15.2, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "那我们怎么去翻本呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 15.2, "to": 17.55, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "翻本的唯一可行做法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 17.55, "to": 20.8, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "就是心甘情愿的做到极致的重复", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 20.8, "to": 24.0, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "那什么叫做心甘情愿的极致的重复呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 24.0, "to": 24.96, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "其实心甘情愿", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 24.96, "to": 28.64, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "它归根结底就是说你要从过程中就享受过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 28.64, "to": 29.66, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "你在选取材料", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 29.66, "to": 31.68, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "选取英语学习方法的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 31.68, "to": 33.02, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "要真正听从", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 33.02, "to": 36.06, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "听从你的内心做那些你哪怕不擅长", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 36.06, "to": 38.48, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "但你也觉得自己喜欢做的事情", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 38.48, "to": 41.04, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "其实很多人他学英语为什么没有成功呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 41.04, "to": 43.12, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "不是因为他们能力不行", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 43.12, "to": 46.84, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "就是因为他们在学习过程中太逼迫自己了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 46.84, "to": 49.4, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "所以他们一直在给自己找不同的苦吃", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 49.4, "to": 51.0, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "他觉得就是要死记硬背", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 51.0, "to": 53.999, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "他觉得就是要去练非常效率低下的听写", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 53.999, "to": 55.659, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "但其实对于普通人来讲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 55.659, "to": 58.98, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "你要发挥英语学习对你人生的巨大的作用", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 58.98, "to": 60.84, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "只要做好三件事情就好了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 60.84, "to": 61.92, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "词汇阅读和听力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 61.92, "to": 64.219, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "那至于究竟听什么", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 64.219, "to": 66.659, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "读什么以及怎么样子去学词汇", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 66.659, "to": 69.639, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "这才是要真正去钻研的部分", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 69.639, "to": 71.199, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "那什么叫极致的重复", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 71.199, "to": 73.82, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "其实极致的重复就是让我们打破一个偏见", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 73.82, "to": 77.22, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "任何你想要去积累的语言组块或者语料也好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 77.22, "to": 77.84, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "词汇也好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 77.84, "to": 81.59, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "它都是靠至少12次以上的重逢和偶遇", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 81.59, "to": 82.85, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "才能被你大脑吸收", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 82.85, "to": 84.82, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "所以你在记忆的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 84.82, "to": 88.02, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "就不应该太过于抱着太高的心理期待", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 88.02, "to": 90.4, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "说我要争取过目不忘的记忆", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 90.4, "to": 92.94, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "而是每一次当你重逢的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 92.94, "to": 94.7, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "就应该为为自己欢呼雀跃", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 94.7, "to": 96.02, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "不管庆祝什么", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 96.02, "to": 97.28, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "就先庆祝就对了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 97.28, "to": 99.96, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "这才是英语学习到最后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 99.96, "to": 101.76, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "能给你带来最大的一个帮助", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 101.76, "to": 103.24, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "那今天就是我的分享", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 103.24, "to": 105.2, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "如果你觉得需要更多一对一辅导的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 105.2, "to": 106.02, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "也可以联系我", "music": 0.0}]}]}